        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1A) For the purpose of paragraph (b) of subsection (1), any cheque issued for the purpose of payment to a person which is not collected by that person or as directed by that person within five bank trading days after the date such cheque is issued shall be credited into the trust account.\"; and"
