        "@value": "by inserting after subsection (3) the following subsection: \"(4) The Minister shall appoint one person from amongst the persons appointed under subsection (3) to be the Executive Chairman of the committee of the stock exchange whose salary and remuneration shall be paid by the stock exchange.\"."
      }
