      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1992/42/eng@/~cl_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1) the following subsection: \"(1) \"Where any person who is under an obligation to comply with, observe, enforce or give effect to any rule or requirement of a stock exchange fails to do so, the stock exchange may, after giving to the person an opportunity of being heard, give directions to that person concerning the compliance with, observance or enforcement of, or the giving effect to, those rules or listing requirements and may further impose a fine not exceeding one hundred thousand ringgit in addition to or in lieu of the penalties provided in the listing requirements of the stock exchange.\"; and"
      }
